<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>About Us — Legacy Home &amp; Respite Care Foundation</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:wght@500;600;700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">
</head>
<body>


{% set active_page = 'about' %}
{% include '_header.html.j2' %}

<section class="hero" style="padding: 56px 0 64px;">
  <div class="container">
    <h1 style="font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 44px);">{{ sections["about.hero"].title }}</h1>
    <p class="lede">{{ sections["about.hero"].lede }}</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section style="padding: 40px 0 8px;">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="card-grid" style="grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));">
      <div class="card"><h3>Our Story</h3><p>How one family's journey became a community's sanctuary.</p><a class="more" href="#story">Read our story →</a></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>Mission &amp; Vision</h3><p>Caregivers first — wellness, rest, and community without judgment.</p><a class="more" href="#mission">What guides us →</a></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>Meet Our Team</h3><p>The people behind Legacy's programs and partnerships.</p><a class="more" href="#team">Meet the team →</a></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>Meet Shanelle</h3><p>Our founder's story — the lived experience behind the mission.</p><a class="more" href="#shanelle">About our founder →</a></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>Board of Directors</h3><p>Governance and leadership.</p><a class="more" href="#board">See the board →</a></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>Annual Reports &amp; Financials</h3><p>Transparency documents and yearly impact reports.</p><a class="more" href="#reports">View reports →</a></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>Careers</h3><p>Work with us to support caregiving families.</p><a class="more" href="#careers">Openings →</a></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>Our Impact</h3><p>The difference we're making, in numbers and stories.</p><a class="more" href="#impact">See our impact →</a></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>Caregiver Voices</h3><p>What caregivers say about the Legacy community.</p><a class="more" href="#voices">Hear their voices →</a></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>Contact</h3><p>Reach a real person — questions, support, media, speaking.</p><a class="more" href="#contact">Get in touch →</a></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="story">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="split">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">{{ sections["about.story"].eyebrow }}</span>
        <h2 style="margin-bottom: 14px;">{{ sections["about.story"].heading }}</h2>
{%- for p in sections["about.story"].paragraphs %}
        <p class="muted mb-16">{{ p }}</p>
{%- endfor %}
        <p class="small muted"><em>{{ sections["about.story"].note }}</em></p>
      </div>
      <div class="visual" id="mission">
        <h3 style="font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 14px;">{{ sections["about.values"].heading }}</h3>
{%- for it in sections["about.values"]["items"] %}
        <div class="timeline-item"><div class="timeline-dot" style="background: var(--coral);"></div><div><strong>{{ it.title }}</strong><div class="when">{{ it.when }}</div></div></div>
{%- endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="shanelle">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head"><span class="eyebrow">Our founder</span><h2>Meet Shanelle</h2></div>
    <p class="muted" style="max-width: 620px;">Legacy's founder cared for her mother through younger-onset dementia — the lived experience the whole organization is built on. Her full story, in her own words, is coming here.</p>
    <span class="badge-phase2">Content coming — Phase 2</span>
  </div>
</section>

<section style="background: var(--sand);" id="team">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head"><span class="eyebrow">Our people</span><h2>Meet Our Team</h2></div>
    <p class="muted" style="max-width: 620px;">Team bios and photos will live here as Legacy shares them.</p>
    <span class="badge-phase2">Content coming — Phase 2</span>
    <div class="section-head" style="margin-top: 40px;" id="board"><span class="eyebrow">Governance</span><h2>Board of Directors</h2></div>
    <p class="muted" style="max-width: 620px;">Board member listings will be published here.</p>
    <span class="badge-phase2">Content coming — Phase 2</span>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="reports">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head"><span class="eyebrow">Transparency</span><h2>Annual Reports &amp; Financials</h2></div>
    <p class="muted" style="max-width: 620px;">Annual reports and financial documents will be available for download here.</p>
    <span class="badge-phase2">Content coming — Phase 2</span>
    <div class="section-head" style="margin-top: 40px;" id="careers"><span class="eyebrow">Join the team</span><h2>Careers</h2></div>
    <p class="muted" style="max-width: 620px;">Open roles will be posted here. Interested in volunteering in the meantime? See <a href="get-involved.html#volunteer">Get Involved</a>.</p>
    <span class="badge-phase2">Content coming — Phase 2</span>
  </div>
</section>

<section style="background: var(--sand);" id="impact">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head"><span class="eyebrow">Our impact</span><h2>Together, we're making a difference.</h2></div>
    <div class="stats-grid" style="text-align:center;">
      <div class="stat"><div class="num" style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 42px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--coral);">70+</div><div class="label">Family Caregivers Supported</div></div>
      <div class="stat"><div class="num" style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 42px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--coral);">1,000+</div><div class="label">Hours of Respite Provided</div></div>
      <div class="stat"><div class="num" style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 42px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--coral);">100,000+</div><div class="label">Community Members Reached</div></div>
      <div class="stat"><div class="num" style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 42px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--coral);">30</div><div class="label">Individuals Living with Dementia</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="section-head" style="margin-top: 40px;" id="voices"><span class="eyebrow">Caregiver voices</span><h2>In their words</h2></div>
    <p style="max-width: 620px; font-style: italic;">"Legacy reminded me that I mattered too."</p>
    <p style="max-width: 620px; font-style: italic;">"Before Legacy, I felt completely alone. Now I have a community that understands what I'm going through."</p>
    <div class="section-head" style="margin-top: 40px;" id="supporters"><span class="eyebrow">With thanks</span><h2>Our Supporters</h2></div>
    <p class="muted" style="max-width: 620px;">The donors, partners, and foundations who make this work possible will be recognized here.</p>
    <span class="badge-phase2">Content coming — Phase 2</span>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="contact">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head"><span class="eyebrow">Contact</span><h2>Reach a real person</h2></div>
    <p class="muted" style="max-width: 620px;">Questions about programs, media inquiries, or speaking requests — start with <a href="request-support.html">Request Support</a> and we'll route it to the right person. Direct contact details will be published here.</p>
    <span class="badge-phase2">Contact details coming — Phase 2</span>
  </div>
</section>

<section style="background: var(--sand);">
  <div class="container text-center">
    <span class="eyebrow">{{ sections["about.join"].eyebrow }}</span>
    <h2 style="margin-bottom: 14px;">{{ sections["about.join"].heading }}</h2>
    <p class="muted" style="max-width: 540px; margin: 0 auto 28px;">{{ sections["about.join"].body }}</p>
    <a href="programs.html" class="btn btn-coral">{{ sections["about.join"].cta_label }}</a>
  </div>
</section>

{% include '_footer.html.j2' %}

<script src="app.js"></script>
<script src="nav-v2.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
